This project implements a simple APB (Advanced Peripheral Bus) system using SystemVerilog. It includes an APB master, slave, interface with master/slave modports, and a top module.

The testbench uses a virtual interface to control and verify APB read and write transactions. A VCD dump is also generated for viewing the waveform in EPWave.

Features
APB Master and Slave
SystemVerilog interface with modports
Virtual interface-based testbench
Read and write transactions
Memory-based APB slave
VCD waveform generation
